tor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":345,"closed_issues":2336,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:21:32Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-10-04T22:43:16Z","updated_at":"2026-10-06T17:11:52Z","closed_at":"2026-10-06T17:11:08Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in: v4.7.stable.official, v4.7.2.stable.official\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.2.stable - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - Intel(R) Iris(R) Xe Graphics (Intel Corporation; 32.0.101.7079) - 13th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-1334U (12 threads) - 31.69 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\n**What is happening?**\nWhen dragging a node to an export_file var (so String type), the Engine spam the message \"Bug: Dictionary::operator[] used when there was no value for the given key \"files\". Please report.\"\n\n**How it should work**\nWhile the engine does not allow the user to drop the node where it shouldn't (correctly), it still spams the error messages.\n\n**Effects on the project**\nPlease note that this bug does NOT seem to break anything: the project seems intact (both my original one and the MRP) during run AND also when restarting (although the bug persists).\n\nThis issue is only because the error message clearly asked to report it.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/95624cc7-7892-438c-b9e0-0f01f83a1bdf\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n**From Blank Project**\n1. Create a Node scene (e.g.: Node2D)\n2. Attach a Script to it (in this example, I'll call it \"PathExporter.gd\" for the sake of clarity)\n3. Create an `@export_file var name: String `\n4. Back to the scene, create _any_ node (in my test and in the MRP, I tried Node2D, Control, CanvasLayer and Node)\n5. Drag and drop the newly created node to the exported variable of the node with PathExporter.gd\n\n**From MRP**\nSimply Drag and Drop any node from the created ones.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[GodotBugMRP.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/33037251/GodotBugMRP.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.co